Wed Nov  4 19:23:08 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to version 4.0.0-beta-2
  * New features and improvements
    + feat: support glob patterns in filter file paths
    + MRESOURCES-162: Add failOnMissingFilterValue option to fail
      build on unresolved filter tokens
    + Add per-resource encoding support (MRESOURCES-281)
    + feat: introduce ChangeDetection strategy for file copy
    + Add nonFilteredFiles glob exclusions and opt-in
      gracefulBinaryHandling
    + Warn when empty filter file entries are skipped
    + Reuse bounded reader during interpolation
    + MSHARED-1412: Allow to customize Interpolator used by filter
  * Bug Fixes
    + MRESOURCES-254: resolve compound ${} references in property
      values with custom delimiters
    + Expand default non-filtered file extensions to include common
      binary formats
    + fix: handle symlinks in source and destination for copyFile
      (MSHARED-1004)
    + fix: restore first resource entry wins for overlapping
      declarations
    + fix: initialize Resource includes/excludes to empty lists
    + fix: remove sensitive property values from debug log output
    + Handle relative Windows paths when escaping
    + Improve malformed input error details
    + fix: handle missing property values
    + Fix resource copy log for project base directory
    + fix: normalize Windows drive paths
    + Recalculate delimiter reader mark length
    + Issue 289: filter file names one component at a time
    + fix: copy missing fields in MavenResourcesExecution.copyOf()
    + Fix setEscapeString(null) to clear escape state
    + Add missing EOF checks in
      MultiDelimiterInterpolatorFilterReaderLineEnding.read()
  * Documentation updates
    + Modernise the download page
  * Maintenance
    + remove pointless code
    + Add Apache prefix to ATR project name
    + Keep SLF4J on 1.7.x and Mockito on 4.x in Dependabot
    + Unused code
    + Restore the document metadata dropped when the pages were
      ported
    + Port the site documentation from APT to Markdown
    + Build against Maven 4.0.0-rc-6
    + Set up for ATR
    + Cleanup tests
    + feat: enable prevent branch protection rules
    + Enable Github Issues
    + MSHARED-1474: Upgrade to Maven 4.0.0-rc-2
    + Use Release Drafter from shared and improvements
    + Add PR Automation
    + Update CI to use 4.0.0-beta-4. Added JDK 23
  * Dependency updates
    + build(deps-dev): bump mockitoVersion from 5.23.0 to 5.24.0
    + Bump mavenVersion from 4.0.0-rc-2 to 4.0.0-rc-7
    + Bump org.apache.maven.shared:maven-shared-components from 43
      to 50
    + Keep SLF4J on 1.7.x and Mockito on 4.x in Dependabot
    + Drop Hamcrest from tests
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-interpolation from 1.27 to
      1.30.0
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /release-drafter.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /maven-verify.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /stale.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump apache/maven-gh-actions-shared/.github/workflows/
      /pr-automation.yml from 4 to 5
    + Bump org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils from 3.0.24 to 4.0.3 in
      /src/test/resources
    + Bump mockitoVersion from 5.12.0 to 5.23.0
    + Update to 47 and site to 2.0.0
    + Bump org.apache.maven.plugin-testing
      :maven-plugin-testing-harness from 4.0.0-beta-2-SNAPSHOT to
      4.0.0-beta-4
    + MSHARED-1455: Upgrade to Maven 4.0.0-rc-1
    + Bump org.hamcrest:hamcrest from 2.2 to 3.0
- Modified patches:
  * 0001-Be-gracious-with-binary-files-among-the-resources-to.patch
  * maven-filtering4-java8compat.patch
    + rebase

